   "pid": "N06",
   "clip": "0161",
   "s": 75.2,
   "e": 77.7,
   "zh": "他说每一帧都是他自己画出来的，",
   "en": "and it said it draws every frame itself,",
   "skip": [],
   "out_s": 63.033,
   "out_e": 65.533
  },
  {
   "pid": "N06",
   "clip": "0161",
   "s": 78.54,
   "e": 80.55,
   "zh": "就是每一个像素，都是他自己画出来的。",
   "en": "every single pixel.",
   "skip": [],
   "out_s": 65.84,
