  },
  {
   "pid": "N06",
   "clip": "0161",
   "s": 94.56,
   "e": 98.32,
   "zh": "用 01 或者 EF 这些之前规定好的颜色画出来的。",
   "en": "using colors it defined beforehand, like 01 or EF.",
   "skip": [],
   "out_s": 71.16,
   "out_e": 74.92
  },
  {
   "pid": "N06",
   "clip": "0161",
   "s": 101.18,
   "e": 102.32,
   "zh": "我觉得真的就很离谱。",
   "en": "Honestly, it's wild.",
   "skip": [],
   "out_s": 75.213,
   "out_e": 76.353
  },
  {
   "pid": "N06",
   "clip": "0161",
   "s": 103.54,
